		{
			dependencies: ["67E8273831E8B9D2"]
			description: [
				"&7This section was last updated for version &6v0.9.0&7.&r"
				""
				"It's a bit of a long story..."
				""
				"Planets and Portals &7(the first modpack)&r was a very &cbasic&r collection of a couple of Forge 1.12.2 mods that I liked, and was by &cno means&r an enjoyable experience, &7at least in my opinion&r. I threw it together for a couple of friends and I back in 2021, and it has since reached over &a11 thousand downloads&r, and I have no idea why! &6You can still find it on Curseforge!&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Considering the success of the first modpack I eventually decided to improve upon it in a more recent version of Minecraft, so I landed on Fabric 1.18.2, and I started development on &6Planets and Portals 2&r in May 2024. I actually got pretty invested in it, but there were a lot of &climitations&r that came with the lack of mods that I really liked not being on Fabric 1.18.2, eventually causing me to suffer from burnout after a couple of weeks."
				""
				"However, I finally cut my losses and &6abandoned Planets and Portals 2&r, opting to go for &6Forge 1.20.1&r instead, which has a much wider selection of more updated mods, and I just couldn't resist it. It did mean having to &6completely change how the modpack is played&r, and losing over 2000 lines of KubeJS code that I had worked for tens of hours on, but I thought it would be &aworth it&r. So here we are, &6Planets and Portals 3&r!"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"If you read all of the above context then I really &aappreciate&r you taking the time to learn the history behind this modpack, so you've earned the &afree cookie&r. I hope you have a great time playing! <3"
			]
			icon: "chipped:mixed_oak_large_bookshelf"
			id: "47509DC6F7C9D88F"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7FA8D0F3189754AC"
				item: "minecraft:cookie"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Wait- what happened to Planets and Portals 1 and 2?"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1436B2A982978842"
				title: "History Lesson"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
