			description: [
				"&7This section was last updated for version &6v0.9.0&7.&r"
				""
				"This modpack aims to &6stretch you out&r."
				""
				"In order to generate large, reliable quantities of resources you'll need to &6travel out a fair distance&r to find hidden underground &6resource deposits&r, which also means you'll need some sort of reliable long-distance &6transport infrastructure&r..."
				""
				"At each planet more powerful resources are unlocked, allowing you to gain greater control over how your factory runs, improve your resource yields, and maybe even do loads of useless, stupid, and fun things along the way!"
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "ad_astra:tier_1_rocket"
